{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415800","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415800","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1041580001:1":{"text":"その花、とてもきれいだわ。","source_cn":"你手中的花朵很美丽。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDA2862F82CDBF24D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1041580002:1":{"text":"どこで手に入れられるか聞いても？次の公演の背景に使いたいの。","source_cn":"请恕我冒昧，它们出自何处？或许可以作为我下一场演出的布景。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2466AD6079356AB7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041580003:0":{"text":"僕の荘園に咲いているサイレンシアだ。好きに持っていくといい。","source_cn":"这是我庄园内的永寂花。拿去吧，无需给我报酬。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF7EAD2671D10F529","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041580004:1":{"text":"だが、僕が持っているこの花たちと違って、他のサイレンシアはいずれ枯れてしまう。舞台の背景に使えるだろうか……","source_cn":"除了我手中这一束，其他永寂花都会凋零。作为舞台布景来说...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDEB74F33D97D3975","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041580005:1":{"text":"問題ないわ。最も美しく、最も相応しいタイミングで、この子たちを観客たちに披露するから。","source_cn":"没关系。它们只会在合适的时刻登场，以最美好的姿态，为观...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0B530396C4E0FD75","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":